<component>
    <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.spinner.title")}</h2>
        <p>Spinner 和 Skeleton 是 RML 的加载指示组件。Spinner 为旋转图标动画，Skeleton 为骨架屏占位。两者均为 <code>StatelessNoId</code> 组件（无 ElementId，<code>RenderOnce</code>）。</p>

        <Card title="Spinner 基础">
            <p>默认 Spinner 使用 <code>Loader</code> 图标，<code>size</code> 控制尺寸。</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="16px" align-items="center">
                <Spinner />
                <Spinner size="small" />
                <Spinner size="medium" />
                <Spinner size="large" />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="Spinner 自定义图标">
            <p><code>icon="Bell"</code> 设置自定义图标（值为 <code>rml_ui::IconName</code> 枚举变体名）。</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="16px" align-items="center">
                <Spinner icon="Loader" />
                <Spinner icon="Bell" size="large" />
                <Spinner icon="Settings" size="medium" />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="Skeleton 骨架屏">
            <p><code>Skeleton</code> 用于内容加载占位。<code>secondary=""</code> 切换为次级颜色。</p>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="8px" width="full">
                <Skeleton />
                <Skeleton secondary="" />
                <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px" width="full">
                    <Skeleton class="w-1/2" />
                    <Skeleton class="w-1/2" secondary="" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="动态加载示例">
            <p>点击按钮切换加载状态，观察 Spinner 与 Skeleton 的显示效果（演示 if 条件渲染 + 字段绑定）：</p>
            <p>当前状态：{loading_label}</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <Button label="切换加载" primary="" on-click={on_toggle_loading} />
            </div>
            <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="8px">
                <div if={is_loading} display="flex" flex-direction="row" gap="8px" align-items="center">
                    <Spinner size="small" />
                    <span>加载中...</span>
                </div>
                <div if={!is_loading}>
                    <p>加载完成！这是内容文本。</p>
                </div>
                <Skeleton if={is_loading} />
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <p>点击下方 Tab 切换 <code>.rml</code> 声明文件与 <code>.rml.rs</code> 后端文件：</p>
            <TabBar selected-index={code_tab} on-click={on_code_tab_change}>
                <Tab label=".rml">
                    <CodeEditor ref="rml_editor" value={rml_sample} language="rml" />
                </Tab>
                <Tab label=".rml.rs">
                    <CodeEditor ref="rust_editor" value={rust_sample} language="rust" />
                </Tab>
            </TabBar>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <h3>Spinner</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>另：<code>size</code> 属性来自 Sizable trait。</p>

            <h3>Skeleton</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={skeleton_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
